  "body": "# [18.1.0](https://github.com/markedjs/marked/compare/v18.0.14...v18.1.0) (2026-10-05)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* avoid cubic backtracking on unicode whitespace in a link destination ([#4106](https://github.com/markedjs/marked/issues/4106)) ([0d20220](https://github.com/markedjs/marked/commit/0d2022025d3cd44750a3ffbb77e2da60635589ee))\n* load CLI configs with top-level await ([#4100](https://github.com/markedjs/marked/issues/4100)) ([c61543e](https://github.com/markedjs/marked/commit/c61543ed0f16121ace9255626abcafe9514cb1b0))\n* reject unbalanced parentheses in link destinations ([#4107](https://github.com/markedjs/marked/issues/4107)) ([3363c99](https://github.com/markedjs/marked/commit/3363c9992123c5d5514a9251fcb01f75d811e660))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* add linkParenPossible to lexer state to fail fast for link token generation ([#4070](https://github.com/markedjs/marked/issues/4070)) ([4ee44f7](https://github.com/markedjs/marked/commit/4ee44f7f2167bec4079255e32b520dd47f16486c))\n\n\n\n",
